WHY GPL v3
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
This is not a choice - it is inherited. Floos's panel rendering, colour
utilities, bitmap gradient generation, texture manager, window background
and progress bar code are adapted from XIUI (https://github.com/tirem/XIUI),
which is licensed GPL v3. Any work derived from it must be released under
the same terms, with source available.

That means if you publish a modified Floos, you must publish your changes
under GPL v3 as well.


BEFORE YOU PUBLISH
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Replace this file with the full, official GPL v3 text from:

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

The notice above is the standard application notice, not the licence
itself. A GPL release is expected to ship the complete text.
